  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Pan&#x2011;African Collective for Evidence works to strengthen the use of evidence in public decision making across Africa. This grant supports the third phase of its Responsive Evidence System for African Policy Needs (REAP) initiative, expanding collaboration among African evidence providers and improving timely access to policy&#x2011;relevant evidence for governments.</narrative>
  </description>
